m "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=3-\\frac{1}{2}t,\\,y=\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{2}-1,\\,t\\ge 2.\n$$\n\nDetermine the ranges of $x$ and $y.$\n\n$x$\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}$,\\,y$\n{{field-3}}{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each variable in turn.\n\n- To find the range of $x,$ note that $3-\\frac{1}{2}t\\le 2$ for all $t\\ge 2.$ Consequently, the range of $x$ is\n\n$$\nx\\le 2.\n$$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ note that $\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{2}-1\\ge 2$ for all $t\\ge 2.$ Consequently, the range of $y$ is\n\n$$\ny\\ge 2.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302286 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bcfaa7b5-c563-53e7-bd92-e6c6e8395aa4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300907}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bcfaa7b5-c563-53e7-bd92-e6c6e8395aa4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300907} :answer-field/id #uuid "187d5fc8-6d6a-5f32-8688-bb8f0cd30671" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301306} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a2815a46-b4d5-5f8d-bc82-d6e5d36ea87f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300779}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a2815a46-b4d5-5f8d-bc82-d6e5d36ea87f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300779} :answer-field/id #uuid "3eff2705-c8d2-58e1-8bc2-412880c9d806" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301435} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ec1b6db-dcf7-5183-9f05-7a81452eee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300520}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ec1b6db-dcf7-5183-9f05-7a81452eee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300520} :answer-field/id #uuid "49dffb7a-d9b2-570d-a601-f27888619af8" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301476} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "217244d5-85da-5c1f-9377-eeaa16debb00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300124}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "217244d5-85da-5c1f-9377-eeaa16debb00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300124} :answer-field/id #uuid "a8515511-0d07-53a2-bb49-746ea67dfa91" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301768}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4a473799-9dcd-5e6d-9f92-4a1b0e38bad7" :question/math-academy-id "q-326304" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=4t-{t}^{2},\\,y={t}^{2}+3,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\n$$\n\ndetermine the ranges of $x$ and $y.$\n\n$x$\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}$,\\,y$\n{{field-3}}{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each variable in turn.\n\n- To find the range of $x,$ we can start by completing the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =4t-{t}^{2} \\\\  & =-({t}^{2}-4t) \\\\  & =-({t}^{2}-4t+4)+4 \\\\  & =-(t-2)^{2}+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $-(t-2)^{2}+4\\le 4,$ we conclude that the range of $x$ is\n\n$$\nx\\le 4.\n$$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ notice that ${t}^{2}+3\\ge 3.$ Consequently, the range of $y$ is\n\n$$\ny\\ge 3.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302287 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "183eace4-e338-5bc7-9a8b-c34f12c92bab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300063}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "183eace4-e338-5bc7-9a8b-c34f12c92bab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300063} :answer-field/id #uuid "1468603f-a543-5515-a97a-0150fa375a7b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301293} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "da881d5a-28d4-5e93-a51d-56a0fa28f022" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301045}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "da881d5a-28d4-5e93-a51d-56a0fa28f022" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301045} :answer-field/id #uuid "3b42eb7e-827b-599d-a098-30f18c64bcbe" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301417} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a2580204-e34e-5d8c-a226-55c9acd1a4e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300777}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a2580204-e34e-5d8c-a226-55c9acd1a4e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300777} :answer-field/id #uuid "47fd0d80-4d34-54dd-8135-ca9d99535331" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301465} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uu